# a format 22 project, from before the master filter (format 23: master[] 16 -> 20 bytes, the settings header four
# bytes longer): saved by that build, for the migration's test (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy). The master moved off its
# defaults on both sides of where the filter's bytes now sit (EQ high 90, comp 77, pump 40), and a track's cutoff after
# the header (T2 cut 33), so a header read at the wrong length shows.
# Run by a format 22 build (22d9613): its loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v22.xy OUT
wait 300
bpm 97
param 2 cut 33
tap GLO
expect page Mix
turn SELECT 1
expect page Master_EQ
spin K3 26
turn SELECT 2
expect page Master_out
spin K3 47
spin K4 40
expect mst.hi 90
expect mst.comp 77
expect mst.pump 40
expect par2.cut 33
projsave 1 v22_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v22.bin
